sequenceDiagram
title Critical Use Case 3: Filter Attractions by Distance
actor User
      
box Attraction Recommendation System
       participant WebApp
       participant FilteringService
       participant MuseumDatabase
end


       User->>WebApp: Open App and Set Distance of 50 Miles
       activate WebApp
       WebApp->>FilteringService: Sends User Location and Range(location, distance)
       activate FilteringService
       FilteringService->>MuseumDatabase: Requests all attraction details in region
       activate MuseumDatabase
       MuseumDatabase-->>FilteringService: Return attraction list ([attraction])
       deactivate MuseumDatabase
       FilteringService->>FilteringService: Calculate each distance
       FilteringService->>FilteringService: Remove attractions not within range
       FilteringService-->>WebApp: Return results
       deactivate FilteringService
       WebApp-->>User: Show results to user
       deactivate WebApp
